# Local credentials. These hold the Gmail app password the webapp Settings page
# writes, and they were NOT ignored until now -- webapp/.env and
# webapp/.env.bak_20260715_100500 both carried a live CMS_IMAP_PASSWORD /
# CMS_SMTP_PASSWORD and were one `git add -A` away from being published.
#
# A password has already leaked from this repo once (see the SECURITY section in
# webapp/README.md). Credentials belong in
# C:\CMS_Local_Workspace\cms_data\email_credentials.json, which lives outside the
# repo, or in the environment -- never in a tracked file.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
